{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090343125630f77e23a944ef","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll design a unique aesthetic. Looking at the progress.md, I've seen palettes like:\n- Amethyst Noir & Platinum\n- Bronze Orchid & Porcelain Noir\n- Ivory & Emerald Noir\n- Copper Noir & Rose Quartz\n- Ruby Noir & Antique Silver\n- Pearl Noir & Brushed Titanium\n- Golden Champagne & Pearl Noir\n- Platinum Noir & Rose Gold\n- And many others...\n\nI'll create a completely new aesthetic: **Cinnamon Noir & Pearl Silk** - warm cinnamon tones with soft pearl silk accents, inspired by natural warmth and sophisticated elegance. This is different from all previous palettes."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eeb7a2c-f67f-41cb-96d5-74761dcc1b1d","uuid":"0c0b15af-c6e6-48bc-a5c5-4c2af1cfb601"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090343125630f77e23a944ef","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_70ca440dbde445ada6584267","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/clinica-milla-lemos-estetica-facial/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Clínica Milla Lemos | Estética Facial em Ribeirão Preto</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Clínica Milla Lemos Estética Facial - Atendimento especializado em harmonização facial e estética avançada em Ribeirão Preto.\">\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        /* ============================================\n           CSS VARIABLES - Cinnamon Noir & Pearl Silk\n           ============================================ */\n        :root {\n            /* Primary Palette - Cinnamon/Warm Spice */\n            --color-cinnamon: #C17F59;\n            --color-cinnamon-light: #D99A72;\n            --color-cinnamon-mid: #E8B090;\n            --color-cinnamon-dark: #A86540;\n            --color-cinnamon-deep: #884A28;\n            --color-cinnamon-shimmer: #F0C8A8;\n\n            /* Accent Palette - Warm Terracotta */\n            --color-terracotta: #D4785C;\n            --color-terracotta-light: #E89878;\n            --color-terracotta-mid: #F0A888;\n            --color-terracotta-dark: #B85840;\n            --color-terracotta-deep: #984030;\n\n            /* Secondary Palette - Pearl Silk */\n            --color-pearl: #E8E4E0;\n            --color-pearl-light: #F0ECE8;\n            --color-pearl-warm: #ECE6E0;\n            --color-pearl-cream: #F8F4F0;\n            --color-silk: #D8D4D0;\n\n            /* Dark Palette - Soft Noir */\n            --color-noir: #1A1816;\n            --color-noir-charcoal: #2A2826;\n            --color-noir-deep: #0F0E0C;\n            --color-espresso: #242018;\n\n            /* Text Colors */\n            --color-text-primary: #1A1816;\n            --color-text-secondary: #4A4846;\n            --color-text-muted: #7A7876;\n            --color-text-on-dark: #F8F4F0;\n\n            /* Gradients */\n            --gradient-cinnamon: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cinnamon) 0%, var(--color-cinnamon-light) 100%);\n            --gradient-terracotta: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-terracotta) 0%, var(--color-terracotta-light) 100%);\n            --gradient-noir: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-noir) 0%, var(--color-noir-charcoal) 100%);\n            --gradient-hero: linear-gradient(135deg, #FAF6F2 0%, #F5EFE8 50%, #F0E8E0 100%);\n            --gradient-cinnamon-terracotta: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cinnamon) 0%, var(--color-terracotta) 100%);\n            --gradient-silk: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-pearl) 0%, var(--color-silk) 100%);\n\n            /* Silk Ribbon Border Radius Shapes */\n            --radius-ribbon-1: 70% 30% 50% 50% / 50% 50% 70% 30%;\n            --radius-ribbon-2: 50% 50% 70% 30% / 30% 70% 50% 50%;\n            --radius-ribbon-3: 60% 40% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%;\n            --radius-ribbon-4: 40% 60% 55% 45% / 45% 55% 45% 55%;\n\n            /* Spacing */\n            --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n            --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n            --spacing-md: 2rem;\n            --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n            --spacing-xl: 6rem;\n\n            /* Typography */\n            --font-display: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;\n            --font-body: 'Jost', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n\n            /* Transitions */\n            --transition-fast: 0.2s ease;\n            --transition-base: 0.4s ease;\n            --transition-slow: 0.6s ease;\n\n            /* Shadows */\n            --shadow-soft: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.08);\n            --shadow-medium: 0 8px 30px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.12);\n            --shadow-strong: 0 12px 40px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.16);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           RESET & BASE STYLES\n           ============================================ */\n        *, *::before, *::after {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            color: var(--color-text-primary);\n            background: var(--color-pearl-cream);\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           TYPOGRAPHY\n           ============================================ */\n        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            color: var(--color-noir);\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n            color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           NAVIGATION\n           ============================================ */\n        .nav {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            z-index: 1000;\n            padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);\n            background: rgba(248, 244, 240, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.06);\n        }\n\n        .nav.hidden {\n            transform: translateY(-100%);\n        }\n\n        .nav-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--color-noir);\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            transition: width var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover {\n            color: var(--color-noir);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover::after {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            color: white !important;\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            transition: transform var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(193, 127, 89, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta::after {\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle span {\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-noir);\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           HERO SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .hero {\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-md);\n            background: var(--gradient-hero);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .hero-blob {\n            position: absolute;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-1);\n            opacity: 0.15;\n            filter: blur(60px);\n            animation: float 20s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .blob-1 {\n            width: 500px;\n            height: 500px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            top: -200px;\n            right: -100px;\n            animation-delay: 0s;\n        }\n\n        .blob-2 {\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background: var(--gradient-terracotta);\n            bottom: -150px;\n            left: -100px;\n            animation-delay: -5s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-2);\n        }\n\n        .blob-3 {\n            width: 300px;\n            height: 300px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon-terracotta);\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 20%;\n            animation-delay: -10s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-3);\n            opacity: 0.1;\n        }\n\n        .blob-4 {\n            width: 250px;\n            height: 250px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cinnamon-light) 0%, var(--color-terracotta-light) 100%);\n            bottom: 20%;\n            right: 15%;\n            animation-delay: -15s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-4);\n            opacity: 0.12;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);\n            }\n            25% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -30px) rotate(5deg) scale(1.05);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) rotate(-5deg) scale(0.95);\n            }\n            75% {\n                transform: translate(-30px, -20px) rotate(3deg) scale(1.02);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--gradient-silk);\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-dark);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n            animation-delay: 0.2s;\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        .hero-subtitle {\n            font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);\n            color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n            animation-delay: 0.4s;\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        .hero-cta {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n            animation-delay: 0.6s;\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            border: none;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            color: white;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(193, 127, 89, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(193, 127, 89, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary {\n            background: transparent;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-cinnamon);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeInUp {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(30px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           PROBLEM/SOLUTION SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .section {\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .section-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .section-subtitle {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .problem-solution-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .card {\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--color-terracotta);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card {\n            background: var(--gradient-noir);\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--color-cinnamon);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-strong);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card p {\n            color: var(--color-pearl-light);\n        }\n\n        .card-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-silk);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card .card-icon {\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n        }\n\n        .card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           SERVICES SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .services-section {\n            background: var(--color-pearl-light);\n        }\n\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: white;\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .service-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            height: 4px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover::before {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-10px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-strong);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon svg {\n            width: 30px;\n            height: 30px;\n            fill: white;\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .service-link {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);\n            transition: gap var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .service-link:hover {\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           TESTIMONIALS SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .testimonials-section {\n            background: var(--gradient-noir);\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-section h2,\n        .testimonials-section p {\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars {\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-shimmer);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-text {\n            color: var(--color-pearl-light);\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-author {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-avatar {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info h4 {\n            color: var(--color-pearl-light);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info span {\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           DIFFERENTIALS SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .differentials-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item:hover {\n            transform: translateX(10px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-cinnamon);\n            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: scale(1);\n                opacity: 1;\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: scale(1.2);\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            fill: white;\n        }\n\n        .differential-content h3 {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           CONTACT SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .contact-section {\n            background: var(--gradient-hero);\n        }\n\n        .contact-container {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .contact-form {\n            background: white;\n            padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-strong);\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .form-label {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-text-primary);\n        }\n\n        .form-input,\n        .form-select,\n        .form-textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 1rem;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-silk);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            background: var(--color-pearl-cream);\n        }\n\n        .form-input:focus,\n        .form-select:focus,\n        .form-textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        .form-textarea {\n            min-height: 120px;\n            resize: vertical;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-icon {\n            width: 45px;\n            height: 45px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-icon svg {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            fill: white;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-text h4 {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-text p {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           FOOTER\n           ============================================ */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--color-noir);\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n            padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .footer-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .footer-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .footer-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.8rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .footer-description {\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .footer-title {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-shimmer);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links li {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a {\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-shimmer);\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding-top: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           ANIMATIONS\n           ============================================ */\n        .wow {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(30px);\n            transition: all 0.6s ease;\n        }\n\n        .wow.active {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           RESPONSIVE\n           ============================================ */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-menu {\n                display: none;\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 100%;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background: white;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                padding: var(--spacing-md);\n                box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.active {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .nav-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .hero-blob {\n                opacity: 0.1;\n            }\n\n            .blob-1, .blob-2 {\n                width: 300px;\n                height: 300px;\n            }\n\n            .blob-3, .blob-4 {\n                width: 200px;\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n\n            .hero-cta {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: stretch;\n            }\n\n            .btn {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .problem-solution-grid,\n            .services-grid,\n            .testimonials-grid,\n            .differentials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            *, *::before, *::after {\n                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-logo\">Milla Lemos</a>\n            <button class=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"navToggle\" aria-label=\"Menu\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </button>\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-link\">Início</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"nav-link\">Serviços</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#depoimentos\" class=\"nav-link\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#diferenciais\" class=\"nav-link\">Diferenciais</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contato\" class=\"nav-link nav-cta\">Agendar</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-2\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-4\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n            <span class=\"hero-badge\">Estética Facial Avançada</span>\n            <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Sua beleza única, realçada com excelência</h1>\n            <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Descubra o poder da harmonização facial com técnicas modernas e atendimento personalizado em Ribeirão Preto</p>\n            <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n                <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                        <path d=\"M19 4h-1V2h-2v2H8V2H6v2H5c-1.11 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L3 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H5V10h14v10zm0-12H5V6h14v2zm-7 5h5v5h-5z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                    Agendar Consulta\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Conhecer Serviços</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Problem/Solution Section -->\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"problema-solucao\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Sua Jornada</span>\n                <h2>Transforme sua autoestima</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"problem-solution-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card problem-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"var(--color-terracotta)\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>O Desafio</h3>\n                    <p>Sinais de envelhecimento, assimetrias faciais ou características que te deixam insegura podem afetar sua confiança e bem-estar.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card solution-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n                            <path d=\"M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>A Solução</h3>\n                    <p>Protocolos personalizados de harmonização facial que realçam seus traços naturais, proporcionando resultados naturais e harmônicos.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card problem-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"var(--color-terracotta)\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>O Resultado</h3>\n                    <p>Uma versão mais confiante de si mesma, com aparência descansada, rejuvenescida e naturalmente bonita.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"section services-section\" id=\"servicos\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Tratamentos</span>\n                <h2>Serviços Especializados</h2>\n                <p>Protocolos personalizados para suas necessidades únicas</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"services-grid\">\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Harmonização Facial</h3>\n                    <p>Equilíbrio e proporção dos traços faciais com técnicas minimamente invasivas e resultados naturais.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 14l-5-5 1.41-1.41L12 14.17l4.59-4.58L18 11l-6 6z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Toxina Botulínica</h3>\n                    <p>Suavização de rugas e linhas de expressão com aplicação estratégica para resultado harmonioso.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2l-5.5 9h11z\"/>\n                            <circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"4.5\"/>\n                            <rect x=\"3\" y=\"13\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Preenchedores Faciais</h3>\n                    <p>Restauração de volume, contorno facial e preenchimento de sulcos com ácido hialurônico de alta qualidade.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8zm3.5-9c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S16.33 8 15.5 8 14 8.67 14 9.5s.67 1.5 1.5 1.5zm-7 0c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5S9.33 8 8.5 8 7 8.67 7 9.5 7.67 11 8.5 11zm3.5 6.5c2.33 0 4.31-1.46 5.11-3.5H6.89c.8 2.04 2.78 3.5 5.11 3.5z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Preenchimento Labial</h3>\n                    <p>Volume e contorno dos lábios com técnicas que proporcionam naturalidade e sensualidade.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 9h-2V7h-2v5H6v2h2v5h2v-5h2v-2z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Bioestimuladores</h3>\n                    <p>Estímulo de colágeno para rejuvenescimento progressivo e natural da pele.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Protocolos Personalizados</h3>\n                    <p>Planos de tratamento exclusivos desenvolvidos de acordo com suas características e objetivos.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Testimonials Section -->\n    <section class=\"section testimonials-section\" id=\"depoimentos\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Depoimentos</span>\n                <h2>O que dizem nossas clientes</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"testimonials-grid\">\n                <div class=\"testimonial-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <p class=\"testimonial-text\">\"Excelente profissional! Fiz harmonização facial e o resultado ficou super natural. Milla atende com muita dedicação e carinho.\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"testimonial-author\">\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-avatar\">AS</div>\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-info\">\n                            <h4>Ana Silva</h4>\n                            <span>Empresária</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"testimonial-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <p class=\"testimonial-text\">\"Fiz preenchimento labial e amei! Ficou muito natural, exatamente como eu queria. Recomendo de olhos fechados!\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"testimonial-author\">\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-avatar\">MC</div>\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-info\">\n                            <h4>Maria Costa</h4>\n                            <span>Advogada</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"testimonial-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <p class=\"testimonial-text\">\"Atendimento impecável desde a primeira consulta. A Milla é muito atenciosa e técnica de primeira. Resultado incrível!\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"testimonial-author\">\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-avatar\">JO</div>\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-info\">\n                            <h4>Juliana Oliveira</h4>\n                            <span>Profissional Liberal</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Differentials Section -->\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"diferenciais\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Por Que Nos Escolher</span>\n                <h2>Nossos Diferenciais</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"differentials-grid\">\n                <div class=\"differential-item wow\">\n                    <div class=\"differential-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"differential-content\">\n                        <h3>Profissional Qualificada</h3>\n                        <p>Experiência e atualização constante com as melhores técnicas do mercado.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"differential-item wow\">\n                    <div class=\"differential-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"differential-content\">\n                        <h3>Produtos de Qualidade</h3>\n                        <p>Utilização exclusiva de produtos certificados e aprovados pela ANVISA.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"differential-item wow\">\n                    <div class=\"differential-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"differential-content\">\n                        <h3>Atendimento Personalizado</h3>\n                        <p>Cada paciente é única: tratamentos desenvolvidos exclusivamente para você.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"differential-item wow\">\n                    <div class=\"differential-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M11.99 2C6.47 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.47 10 9.99 10C17.52 22 22 17.52 22 12S17.52 2 11.99 2zM12 20c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8s3.58-8 8-8 8 3.58 8 8-3.58 8-8 8zm.5-13H11v6l5.25 3.15.75-1.23-4.5-2.67z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"differential-content\">\n                        <h3>Pontualidade</h3>\n                        <p>Respeito ao seu tempo com atendimento dentro do horário agendado.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"differential-item wow\">\n                    <div class=\"differential-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"differential-content\">\n                        <h3>Ambiente Seguro</h3>\n                        <p>Espaço higienizado e equipado com todos os protocolos de segurança.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"differential-item wow\">\n                    <div class=\"differential-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M20 2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v18l4-4h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 14H6l-2 2V4h16v12z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"differential-content\">\n                        <h3>Acompanhamento</h3>\n                        <p>Suporte contínuo antes e depois dos procedimentos para sua tranquilidade.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Contact Section -->\n    <section class=\"section contact-section\" id=\"contato\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Contato</span>\n                <h2>Agende sua Consulta</h2>\n                <p>Entre em contato e transforme sua autoestima hoje mesmo</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"contact-container\">\n                <form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contactForm\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"name\">Nome Completo</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" class=\"form-input\" placeholder=\"Seu nome\" required>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"phone\">Telefone</label>\n                        <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" class=\"form-input\" placeholder=\"(XX) XXXXX-XXXX\" required>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"service\">Serviço de Interesse</label>\n                        <select id=\"service\" name=\"service\" class=\"form-select\" required>\n                            <option value=\"\">Selecione um serviço</option>\n                            <option value=\"Harmonização Facial\">Harmonização Facial</option>\n                            <option value=\"Toxina Botulínica\">Toxina Botulínica</option>\n                            <option value=\"Preenchedores Faciais\">Preenchedores Faciais</option>\n                            <option value=\"Preenchimento Labial\">Preenchimento Labial</option>\n                            <option value=\"Bioestimuladores\">Bioestimuladores</option>\n                            <option value=\"Protocolos Personalizados\">Protocolos Personalizados</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"message\">Mensagem</label>\n                        <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" class=\"form-textarea\" placeholder=\"Conte-nos sobre suas expectativas...\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%; justify-content: center;\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                        Enviar via WhatsApp\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n\n                <div class=\"contact-info\">\n                    <div class=\"contact-info-item\">\n                        <div class=\"contact-info-icon\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path d=\"M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"contact-info-text\">\n                            <h4>Endereço</h4>\n                            <p>R. Emma Barcarollo Guimarães, 117 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-595</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"contact-info-item\">\n                        <div class=\"contact-info-icon\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path d=\"M6.62 10.79c1.44 2.83 3.76 5.14 6.59 6.59l2.2-2.2c.27-.27.67-.36 1.02-.24 1.12.37 2.33.57 3.57.57.55 0 1 .45 1 1V20c0 .55-.45 1-1 1-9.39 0-17-7.61-17-17 0-.55.45-1 1-1h3.5c.55 0 1 .45 1 1 0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57.11.35.03.74-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"contact-info-text\">\n                            <h4>Telefone</h4>\n                            <p>(16) 98156-3060</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n                <div>\n                    <div class=\"footer-logo\">Milla Lemos</div>\n                    <p class=\"footer-description\">Estética Facial Avançada em Ribeirão Preto. Transformando vidas através da harmonização facial com excelência e carinho.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"footer-title\">Links Rápidos</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                        <li><a href=\"#home\">Início</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Serviços</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#depoimentos\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#diferenciais\">Diferenciais</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#contato\">Contato</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"footer-title\">Serviços</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                        <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Harmonização Facial</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Toxina Botulínica</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Preenchedores</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Bioestimuladores</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"footer-title\">Contato</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                        <li>(16) 98156-3060</li>\n                        <li>R. Emma Barcarollo Guimarães, 117</li>\n                        <li>Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP</li>\n                        <li>14021-595</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n                <p>&copy; 2024 Clínica Milla Lemos Estética Facial. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // Navigation auto-hide on scroll\n        let lastScroll = 0;\n        const nav = document.getElementById('nav');\n\n        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {\n            const currentScroll = window.pageYOffset;\n\n            if (currentScroll > lastScroll && currentScroll > 100) {\n                nav.classList.add('hidden');\n            } else {\n                nav.classList.remove('hidden');\n            }\n\n            lastScroll = currentScroll;\n        });\n\n        // Mobile menu toggle\n        const navToggle = document.getElementById('navToggle');\n        const navMenu = document.getElementById('navMenu');\n\n        navToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            navMenu.classList.toggle('active');\n        });\n\n        // Close menu on link click\n        document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link').forEach(link => {\n            link.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                navMenu.classList.remove('active');\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Smooth scroll for anchor links\n        document.querySelectorAll('a[href^=\"#\"]').forEach(anchor => {\n            anchor.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                const target = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href'));\n                if (target) {\n                    const navHeight = nav.offsetHeight;\n                    const targetPosition = target.getBoundingClientRect().top + window.pageYOffset - navHeight;\n                    window.scrollTo({\n                        top: targetPosition,\n                        behavior: 'smooth'\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Intersection Observer for scroll animations\n        const observerOptions = {\n            threshold: 0.1,\n            rootMargin: '0px 0px -50px 0px'\n        };\n\n        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n            entries.forEach(entry => {\n                if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                    entry.target.classList.add('active');\n                    observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n                }\n            });\n        }, observerOptions);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.wow').forEach(el => {\n            observer.observe(el);\n        });\n\n        // Contact form with WhatsApp integration\n        const contactForm = document.getElementById('contactForm');\n\n        contactForm.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n            e.preventDefault();\n\n            const name = document.getElementById('name').value;\n            const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value;\n            const service = document.getElementById('service').value;\n            const message = document.getElementById('message').value;\n\n            const whatsappMessage = `Olá! Meu nome é ${name}.\\nTelefone: ${phone}\\nServiço de interesse: ${service}\\n\\nMensagem: ${message}`;\n\n            const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/5516981563060?text=${encodeURIComponent(whatsappMessage)}`;\n\n            window.open(whatsappUrl, '_blank');\n        });\n\n        // Parallax effect for hero blobs\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const moveX = (e.clientX - window.innerWidth / 2) / 50;\n            const moveY = (e.clientY - window.innerHeight / 2) / 50;\n\n            document.querySelectorAll('.hero-blob').forEach((blob, index) => {\n                const speed = (index + 1) * 0.5;\n                blob.style.transform = `translate(${moveX * speed}px, ${moveY * speed}px)`;\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eeb7a2c-f67f-41cb-96d5-74761dcc1b1d","uuid":"5d704cdb-31af-4562-b16f-efe10372b7bf"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_70ca440dbde445ada6584267","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/clinica-milla-lemos-estetica-facial/index.html"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9eeb7a2c-f67f-41cb-96d5-74761dcc1b1d","uuid":"54a778dc-f6f6-4592-9c3b-4c828f353d9b","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/clinica-milla-lemos-estetica-facial/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Clínica Milla Lemos | Estética Facial em Ribeirão Preto</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Clínica Milla Lemos Estética Facial - Atendimento especializado em harmonização facial e estética avançada em Ribeirão Preto.\">\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        /* ============================================\n           CSS VARIABLES - Cinnamon Noir & Pearl Silk\n           ============================================ */\n        :root {\n            /* Primary Palette - Cinnamon/Warm Spice */\n            --color-cinnamon: #C17F59;\n            --color-cinnamon-light: #D99A72;\n            --color-cinnamon-mid: #E8B090;\n            --color-cinnamon-dark: #A86540;\n            --color-cinnamon-deep: #884A28;\n            --color-cinnamon-shimmer: #F0C8A8;\n\n            /* Accent Palette - Warm Terracotta */\n            --color-terracotta: #D4785C;\n            --color-terracotta-light: #E89878;\n            --color-terracotta-mid: #F0A888;\n            --color-terracotta-dark: #B85840;\n            --color-terracotta-deep: #984030;\n\n            /* Secondary Palette - Pearl Silk */\n            --color-pearl: #E8E4E0;\n            --color-pearl-light: #F0ECE8;\n            --color-pearl-warm: #ECE6E0;\n            --color-pearl-cream: #F8F4F0;\n            --color-silk: #D8D4D0;\n\n            /* Dark Palette - Soft Noir */\n            --color-noir: #1A1816;\n            --color-noir-charcoal: #2A2826;\n            --color-noir-deep: #0F0E0C;\n            --color-espresso: #242018;\n\n            /* Text Colors */\n            --color-text-primary: #1A1816;\n            --color-text-secondary: #4A4846;\n            --color-text-muted: #7A7876;\n            --color-text-on-dark: #F8F4F0;\n\n            /* Gradients */\n            --gradient-cinnamon: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cinnamon) 0%, var(--color-cinnamon-light) 100%);\n            --gradient-terracotta: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-terracotta) 0%, var(--color-terracotta-light) 100%);\n            --gradient-noir: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-noir) 0%, var(--color-noir-charcoal) 100%);\n            --gradient-hero: linear-gradient(135deg, #FAF6F2 0%, #F5EFE8 50%, #F0E8E0 100%);\n            --gradient-cinnamon-terracotta: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cinnamon) 0%, var(--color-terracotta) 100%);\n            --gradient-silk: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-pearl) 0%, var(--color-silk) 100%);\n\n            /* Silk Ribbon Border Radius Shapes */\n            --radius-ribbon-1: 70% 30% 50% 50% / 50% 50% 70% 30%;\n            --radius-ribbon-2: 50% 50% 70% 30% / 30% 70% 50% 50%;\n            --radius-ribbon-3: 60% 40% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%;\n            --radius-ribbon-4: 40% 60% 55% 45% / 45% 55% 45% 55%;\n\n            /* Spacing */\n            --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n            --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n            --spacing-md: 2rem;\n            --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n            --spacing-xl: 6rem;\n\n            /* Typography */\n            --font-display: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;\n            --font-body: 'Jost', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n\n            /* Transitions */\n            --transition-fast: 0.2s ease;\n            --transition-base: 0.4s ease;\n            --transition-slow: 0.6s ease;\n\n            /* Shadows */\n            --shadow-soft: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.08);\n            --shadow-medium: 0 8px 30px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.12);\n            --shadow-strong: 0 12px 40px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.16);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           RESET & BASE STYLES\n           ============================================ */\n        *, *::before, *::after {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            color: var(--color-text-primary);\n            background: var(--color-pearl-cream);\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           TYPOGRAPHY\n           ============================================ */\n        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            color: var(--color-noir);\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n            color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           NAVIGATION\n           ============================================ */\n        .nav {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            z-index: 1000;\n            padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);\n            background: rgba(248, 244, 240, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(26, 24, 22, 0.06);\n        }\n\n        .nav.hidden {\n            transform: translateY(-100%);\n        }\n\n        .nav-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--color-noir);\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            transition: width var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover {\n            color: var(--color-noir);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover::after {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            color: white !important;\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            transition: transform var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(193, 127, 89, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta::after {\n            display: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            background: none;\n            border: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .nav-toggle span {\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-noir);\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           HERO SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .hero {\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-md);\n            background: var(--gradient-hero);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .hero-blob {\n            position: absolute;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-1);\n            opacity: 0.15;\n            filter: blur(60px);\n            animation: float 20s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .blob-1 {\n            width: 500px;\n            height: 500px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            top: -200px;\n            right: -100px;\n            animation-delay: 0s;\n        }\n\n        .blob-2 {\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background: var(--gradient-terracotta);\n            bottom: -150px;\n            left: -100px;\n            animation-delay: -5s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-2);\n        }\n\n        .blob-3 {\n            width: 300px;\n            height: 300px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon-terracotta);\n            top: 50%;\n            left: 20%;\n            animation-delay: -10s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-3);\n            opacity: 0.1;\n        }\n\n        .blob-4 {\n            width: 250px;\n            height: 250px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cinnamon-light) 0%, var(--color-terracotta-light) 100%);\n            bottom: 20%;\n            right: 15%;\n            animation-delay: -15s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-ribbon-4);\n            opacity: 0.12;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);\n            }\n            25% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -30px) rotate(5deg) scale(1.05);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) rotate(-5deg) scale(0.95);\n            }\n            75% {\n                transform: translate(-30px, -20px) rotate(3deg) scale(1.02);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--gradient-silk);\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-dark);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n            animation-delay: 0.2s;\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        .hero-subtitle {\n            font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);\n            color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n            animation-delay: 0.4s;\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        .hero-cta {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n            animation-delay: 0.6s;\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            cursor: pointer;\n            border: none;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            color: white;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(193, 127, 89, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(193, 127, 89, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary {\n            background: transparent;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-cinnamon);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeInUp {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(30px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           PROBLEM/SOLUTION SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .section {\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .section-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .section-subtitle {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .problem-solution-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .card {\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--color-terracotta);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card {\n            background: var(--gradient-noir);\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--color-cinnamon);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-strong);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card p {\n            color: var(--color-pearl-light);\n        }\n\n        .card-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-silk);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card .card-icon {\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n        }\n\n        .card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.3rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           SERVICES SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .services-section {\n            background: var(--color-pearl-light);\n        }\n\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: white;\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .service-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            height: 4px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover::before {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-10px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-strong);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon svg {\n            width: 30px;\n            height: 30px;\n            fill: white;\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .service-link {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);\n            transition: gap var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .service-link:hover {\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           TESTIMONIALS SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .testimonials-section {\n            background: var(--gradient-noir);\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-section h2,\n        .testimonials-section p {\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card:hover {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars {\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-shimmer);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-text {\n            color: var(--color-pearl-light);\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-author {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-avatar {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info h4 {\n            color: var(--color-pearl-light);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info span {\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           DIFFERENTIALS SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .differentials-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item:hover {\n            transform: translateX(10px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-cinnamon);\n            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: scale(1);\n                opacity: 1;\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: scale(1.2);\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            fill: white;\n        }\n\n        .differential-content h3 {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           CONTACT SECTION\n           ============================================ */\n        .contact-section {\n            background: var(--gradient-hero);\n        }\n\n        .contact-container {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .contact-form {\n            background: white;\n            padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-strong);\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .form-label {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-text-primary);\n        }\n\n        .form-input,\n        .form-select,\n        .form-textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 1rem;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-silk);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            background: var(--color-pearl-cream);\n        }\n\n        .form-input:focus,\n        .form-select:focus,\n        .form-textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--color-cinnamon);\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        .form-textarea {\n            min-height: 120px;\n            resize: vertical;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-md);\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n            padding: var(--spacing-md);\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-icon {\n            width: 45px;\n            height: 45px;\n            background: var(--gradient-cinnamon);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-icon svg {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            fill: white;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-text h4 {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info-text p {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           FOOTER\n           ============================================ */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--color-noir);\n            color: var(--color-text-on-dark);\n            padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .footer-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .footer-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .footer-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.8rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n        }\n\n        .footer-description {\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n        }\n\n        .footer-title {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-shimmer);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links li {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a {\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: var(--color-cinnamon-shimmer);\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding-top: var(--spacing-md);\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            color: var(--color-text-muted);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           ANIMATIONS\n           ============================================ */\n        .wow {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(30px);\n            transition: all 0.6s ease;\n        }\n\n        .wow.active {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        /* ============================================\n           RESPONSIVE\n           ============================================ */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-menu {\n                display: none;\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 100%;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background: white;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                padding: var(--spacing-md);\n                box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.active {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .nav-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .hero-blob {\n                opacity: 0.1;\n            }\n\n            .blob-1, .blob-2 {\n                width: 300px;\n                height: 300px;\n            }\n\n            .blob-3, .blob-4 {\n                width: 200px;\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n\n            .hero-cta {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: stretch;\n            }\n\n            .btn {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .problem-solution-grid,\n            .services-grid,\n            .testimonials-grid,\n            .differentials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            *, *::before, *::after {\n                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-logo\">Milla Lemos</a>\n            <button class=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"navToggle\" aria-label=\"Menu\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </button>\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-link\">Início</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"nav-link\">Serviços</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#depoimentos\" class=\"nav-link\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#diferenciais\" class=\"nav-link\">Diferenciais</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contato\" class=\"nav-link nav-cta\">Agendar</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-2\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"hero-blob blob-4\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n            <span class=\"hero-badge\">Estética Facial Avançada</span>\n            <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Sua beleza única, realçada com excelência</h1>\n            <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Descubra o poder da harmonização facial com técnicas modernas e atendimento personalizado em Ribeirão Preto</p>\n            <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n                <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                        <path d=\"M19 4h-1V2h-2v2H8V2H6v2H5c-1.11 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L3 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H5V10h14v10zm0-12H5V6h14v2zm-7 5h5v5h-5z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                    Agendar Consulta\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Conhecer Serviços</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Problem/Solution Section -->\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"problema-solucao\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Sua Jornada</span>\n                <h2>Transforme sua autoestima</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"problem-solution-grid\">\n                <div class=\"card problem-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"var(--color-terracotta)\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>O Desafio</h3>\n                    <p>Sinais de envelhecimento, assimetrias faciais ou características que te deixam insegura podem afetar sua confiança e bem-estar.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card solution-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n                            <path d=\"M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>A Solução</h3>\n                    <p>Protocolos personalizados de harmonização facial que realçam seus traços naturais, proporcionando resultados naturais e harmônicos.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card problem-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"var(--color-terracotta)\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>O Resultado</h3>\n                    <p>Uma versão mais confiante de si mesma, com aparência descansada, rejuvenescida e naturalmente bonita.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"section services-section\" id=\"servicos\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Tratamentos</span>\n                <h2>Serviços Especializados</h2>\n                <p>Protocolos personalizados para suas necessidades únicas</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"services-grid\">\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Harmonização Facial</h3>\n                    <p>Equilíbrio e proporção dos traços faciais com técnicas minimamente invasivas e resultados naturais.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"service-card wow\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                            <path d=\"M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 14l-5-5 1.41-1.41L12 14.17l4.59-4.58L18 11l-6 6z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Toxina Botulínica</h3>\n                    <p>Suavização de rugas e linhas de expressão com aplicação estratégica para resultado harmonioso.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.5